{"vid":"7OduXzYO4p0","source":"7OduXzYO4p0.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":5.5,"txt":"In the world of professional welding,"},{"t":7,"txt":"standards are not just guidelines."},{"t":9.7,"txt":"They are the blueprints for safety and"},{"t":11.8,"txt":"success."},{"t":13.2,"txt":"Today, we're getting to the root of"},{"t":14.6,"txt":"welding excellence and one of the key"},{"t":16.4,"txt":"roles within the shop to maintain those"},{"t":18.3,"txt":"CSA standards."},{"t":20.5,"txt":"For companies certified to CSA standards"},{"t":22.6,"txt":"such as W47.1,"},{"t":25.1,"txt":"W47.2,"},{"t":26.6,"txt":"and W186,"},{"t":28.4,"txt":"there's one key role that's instrumental"},{"t":30.6,"txt":"to their successful operations, the"},{"t":32.4,"txt":"welding supervisor. The welding"},{"t":34.2,"txt":"supervisor has the responsibility to"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"uphold and maintain the highest"},{"t":38.4,"txt":"standards in welding operations within"},{"t":40.8,"txt":"the shop."},{"t":42,"txt":"The role of the welding supervisor is"},{"t":43.5,"txt":"involved in all levels of the weldment,"},{"t":45.7,"txt":"from materials procurement, welding and"},{"t":48,"txt":"fabrication, and the final inspection of"},{"t":50.4,"txt":"the product. For large companies that"},{"t":52.2,"txt":"run shift work, a qualified welding"},{"t":54.3,"txt":"supervisor is required for each shift."},{"t":57,"txt":"And when it comes to onsite"},{"t":58,"txt":"construction, their presence is not only"},{"t":60.3,"txt":"indispensable, but also required."},{"t":62.8,"txt":"Becoming a welding supervisor means"},{"t":64.4,"txt":"having at least 5 years of relevant"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"industry experience and passing a"},{"t":68.6,"txt":"variety of exams administered by the"},{"t":70.8,"txt":"CWB."},{"t":72.6,"txt":"These include tests on weld symbols,"},{"t":75,"txt":"quality control, recognizing weld"},{"t":76.9,"txt":"discontinuities, and weld inspection."},{"t":79.4,"txt":"Once someone passes all the exams and is"},{"t":81.4,"txt":"certified, a welding supervisor ensures"},{"t":83.8,"txt":"that all welding personnel on the job"},{"t":85.8,"txt":"are up to the task with the right"},{"t":87.6,"txt":"qualifications and adherence to any"},{"t":89.6,"txt":"required procedures. Their role and"},{"t":91.9,"txt":"responsibilities can extend to"},{"t":93.2,"txt":"on-the-job training, especially those"},{"t":95.6,"txt":"new to welding."},{"t":97.4,"txt":"Always emphasizing safety and specific"},{"t":99.4,"txt":"welding operations within the company,"},{"t":102.8,"txt":"supervisors are also adept at preparing"},{"t":105,"txt":"test samples for qualification tests and"},{"t":107.6,"txt":"ensuring that the team can interpret"},{"t":109.5,"txt":"welding procedure data sheets"},{"t":111,"txt":"accurately. The welding supervisor is"},{"t":113.2,"txt":"the person that welders and and alike"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"can go to for any clarification on"},{"t":118.3,"txt":"welding related questions. Collaboration"},{"t":120.5,"txt":"with engineers to develop and"},{"t":121.9,"txt":"pre-qualify welding procedure"},{"t":123.5,"txt":"specifications is another critical task,"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"always ensuring that any welding"},{"t":128.2,"txt":"complies with necessary CSA standards."},{"t":131.6,"txt":"Are you ready to take the first steps"},{"t":133,"txt":"towards becoming a supervisor?"},{"t":135.1,"txt":"Visit cwbgroup.org and explore the"},{"t":137.5,"txt":"courses available."},{"t":139.3,"txt":"For exam registrations and questions,"},{"t":141.1,"txt":"call 1-800-844-6790."},{"t":145.1,"txt":"Preparation is the key, so study"},{"t":147.3,"txt":"diligently and ensure you're familiar"},{"t":149,"txt":"with the weld symbols, quality control,"},{"t":151,"txt":"weld faults, and the code itself. We"},{"t":153.2,"txt":"recommend that you become proficient in"},{"t":154.9,"txt":"navigating and understanding the code"},{"t":156.5,"txt":"book. Empower your career and ensure the"},{"t":158.8,"txt":"highe